The power map sends the principal filter of a neighbourhood to the principal filter, in the power system, generated by the up-set of that neighbourhood.

Extensionality of filters compares the two sides. An up-set of a neighbourhood above the given neighbourhood lies in the principal filter of the up-set, because inclusion of neighbourhoods is inclusion of up-sets. An up-set containing the up-set of the given neighbourhood comes from a neighbourhood above it, by the same inclusion law.
